WEBVTT

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:56.990
And Dragon Ball Z, Cell took to the airwaves to announce his malicious plan.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.090
Bring me your fighters and I will face them one by one.

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.690
If I am not defeated, the Earth boost.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:13.700
Viewers worldwide could do little more than stare into their television screens,

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.300
hoping to wake up from this horrible dream.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:19.530
But unfortunately, the nightmare is real.

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:22.150
Today, on Dragon Ball Z.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.990
The entire planet is in a state of chaos after Cell's televised doomsday message.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:46.430
In every city and every town, people are gathering up what they can and fleeing in terror.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.790
But with Cell on the watch, don't they realize that there's nowhere left to run?

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.240
Let's hold up. Let's move it.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.880
Hurry up before we're all dead.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:02:59.800
I've had it.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.950
Oh, I wish there was some place we could hide until this blows over.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.640
But, but, but, but, the safe place is left.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:50.730
We borrow Bulma's ship, orbit the Earth, and then sit back and watch the fireworks.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:57.500
Yeah, I bet ol' Cell would never think to look for us up in outer space.

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.070
I just had to destroy it. That was so dumb.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.730
It's all my fault that this happened.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.410
Zell, take her.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:37.090
And I made him complete.

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.700
I've got to stop him!

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.420
Krillin! Stop right there!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:52.080
You know good and well that you are no match for him, Krillin,

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.230
