00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:56.070
Understand?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.800
But, if you still insist, then enter his tournament and face him there.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.800
Hey, don't be so hard on yourself, Krillin.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:15.910
Before we do anything, we should talk to Goku and Gohan.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:19.710
If anyone is going to stop Cell, it'll be one of those two.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:23.630
Let's just hope they've advanced enough in their Super Saiyan training.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:38.330
